{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMjMvQSUyMEJsb29keSUyMEx1Y2t5JTIwRGF5JTIwJTI4MjAyMyUyOS8","type":"series","name":"A Bloody Lucky Day","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/qUlJJzr7OyhU9j0m1jhF4bdgzak.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/n5MmniUioLeJvAujEDSyAts8SiO.jpg","description":"An ordinary taxi driver becomes entangled with a customer that turns out to be a serial killer.\n\nComplete series. On your server: S1 10/10","releaseInfo":"2023","genres":["Crime","Drama","Korean"],"videos":[{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMjMvQSUyMEJsb29keSUyMEx1Y2t5JTIwRGF5JTIwJTI4MjAyMyUyOS8.1.1","title":"Taxi Driver","season":1,"episode":1,"released":"2023-11-24T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Oh Taek's last customer Geum Hyuk-soo asks if Taek could drive him to Mukpo and he accepts the offer. When Hyuk-soo says he killed a man before, Oh Taek senses something is wrong.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1kowNF6JoZHMr0tinQWy0sPHRAk.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMjMvQSUyMEJsb29keSUyMEx1Y2t5JTIwRGF5JTIwJTI4MjAyMyUyOS8.1.2","title":"It's Hard to Find Good People","season":1,"episode":2,"released":"2023-11-24T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Oh Taek hits the road again without realizing Geum Hyuk-soo's murder at the rest stop. Hwang Soong-yu suspects that Geum Hyuk-soo is behind her son's suicide. She decides to chase Geum Hyuk-soo herself.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/f6uDLx6mRSlXRwzIBAqsUqYjeye.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMjMvQSUyMEJsb29keSUyMEx1Y2t5JTIwRGF5JTIwJTI4MjAyMyUyOS8.1.3","title":"Everything Comes with a Price","season":1,"episode":3,"released":"2023-11-24T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"While Oh Taek continues to listen to Geum Hyuk-soo's confession of his murders, he runs into a highway patrol. However, due to the fear of Geum Hyuk-soo's threat, Oh Taek blows up his chance.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zlUDgR9k3roFgfS7k75Q8QAzSTV.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMjMvQSUyMEJsb29keSUyMEx1Y2t5JTIwRGF5JTIwJTI4MjAyMyUyOS8.1.4","title":"The Sheep and the Wolf","season":1,"episode":4,"released":"2023-11-24T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Kim Joong-min finds Geum Hyuk-soo's fingerprints in the camper van. Hwang Soong-yu finds the taxi, but Hyuk-soo and Taek are already gone. Oh Taek barely escapes from Hyuk-soo and calls the police.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/crj2t9puAs5C5Fjq26GjdynDL6l.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMjMvQSUyMEJsb29keSUyMEx1Y2t5JTIwRGF5JTIwJTI4MjAyMyUyOS8.1.5","title":"The Smiling Man","season":1,"episode":5,"released":"2023-11-24T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Taek contemplates after Hyuk-soo's call that if he does not return to the remote house, Seung-mi will be killed. Hyuk-soo tells Taek that Seung-mi will only be spared if he manages to smuggle out.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cCjSeVPjqVlDrkZeHwSGB8YOMAx.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMjMvQSUyMEJsb29keSUyMEx1Y2t5JTIwRGF5JTIwJTI4MjAyMyUyOS8.1.6","title":"What Happens Happens","season":1,"episode":6,"released":"2023-11-24T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Taek calls Kim Joong-min in secret and informs where Hyuk-soo is going. However, Hyuk-soo soon finds out, and Seung-mi is in danger.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8iZFxw4UKUiET2RMD4Sxo3vZLeC.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMjMvQSUyMEJsb29keSUyMEx1Y2t5JTIwRGF5JTIwJTI4MjAyMyUyOS8.1.7","title":"Misfortune Doesn't Ask Why","season":1,"episode":7,"released":"2023-12-08T00:00:00.000Z","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uGdyph9KKZqvl9hxoulpwkYjVlw.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMjMvQSUyMEJsb29keSUyMEx1Y2t5JT